      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a customer support assistant. Analyse the message below.\n\nRules:\n- summary: one short sentence\n- category: one of complaint, question, feedback, other\n- sentiment: one of angry, neutral, happy\n- urgent: set to true ONLY if at least one of these is clearly true:\n  1. Money problem: a payment failed, money was deducted, or the customer was charged twice.\n  2. The item arrived damaged or defective, or the customer received a different product than the one ordered.\n  3. Time-sensitive request: the customer needs something done today or before the order ships (for example changing the address of an order that ships today).\n  4. The same problem happened more than once (for example \"third time\", \"second time\", \"again\", \"still not fixed\").\n  5. The customer demands an immediate refund, or threatens to leave or complain publicly.\n  Otherwise set urgent to false.\n  These are NOT urgent: a normal status question like \"where is my order\", a wrong size, a small difference from the photo, mild disappointment, normal questions, and normal feedback.\n- confidence: a number from 0 to 1, how sure you are about the category. Use 0.9 or higher only if the message is clear and specific and fits exactly one category. Use below 0.6 if the message is vague, very short, or could fit more than one category.\n\nCustomer name: {{ $json.name }}\nCustomer message: {{ $json.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
